OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry in the morning with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Staying dry and bright
OL,7,Fin the east in the afternoon, though
OL,8,Fsomewhat cloudier for a time. Cloudier
OL,9,Fin the west with the odd light shower
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry to start with some
OL,13,Fevening sunshine, then clear spells.
OL,14,FCloud and outbreaks of rain spread
OL,15,Feast overnight, rain occasionally
OL,16,Fheavy towards morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
