OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,7,Fnortheast. Some brighter spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon along with
OL,9,Fa few heavy showers. Becoming quite
OL,10,Fbreezy in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain on Wednesday morning, likely
OL,15,Fturning brighter later with a few
OL,16,Fshowers. Bright spells and scattered
OL,17,Fshowers on Thursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
